# Tauqe runtime artifacts
#
# The whole state directory stays out of the repository: credentials, history,
# plans, reviews, mockups, and the reference cache are runtime data, not sources.
# The reference registry is the one tracked path inside it, so the directory is
# re-included, every sibling is excluded again, and the manifest alone is
# re-included once more. A rule later in this file overrides an earlier one, and
# Git descends only into a directory no rule ignores, so the order is load-bearing.
!.tauqe
.tauqe/*
!.tauqe/refs/
.tauqe/refs/*
!.tauqe/refs/refs.md

# Transient file-operation siblings (staged writes and rollback backups)
*.tauqe-tmp
*.tauqe-bak

# mdBook build artifacts
docs/book/
